# Distributed as-is to every onboarded repo's root (see setup/precommit.py distribute()).
# Normalizes line endings at commit time so a Windows checkout (CRLF by default) and a macOS/Linux
# one (LF) never produce a cross-machine diff on text the moteur or a human edits (CHANTIER0001
# portage-windows-du-moteur — the framework has to run on the author's Mac, a Windows machine, and
# a colleague's laptop). `eol=lf` pins the normalized form to LF rather than leaving it to whichever
# machine commits first.
* text=auto eol=lf
